sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as ExperimentConfig
    participant FD as FraudDataset
    participant FP as FraudPreprocessor
    participant P as FraudDetectionPipeline
    participant S as TabNetFeatureSelector
    participant LSTM as LSTMDetector
    participant TN as TabNetDetector
    participant E as FraudModelEvaluator

    C->>C: ExperimentConfig()
    FD->>FD: load(data_file)
    FD->>FD: clean(df)
    FD->>FD: split(df, config)
    FD-->>FP: DatasetSplits

    FP->>FP: FraudFeatureEngineer.transform()
    FP->>FP: RobustScaler.fit_transform()
    FP->>FP: StandardScaler.fit_transform()
    FP->>FP: SMOTE.fit_resample()
    FP-->>P: PreparedData

    P->>S: TabNetFeatureSelector.fit_transform(data)
    S->>S: Train temporary TabNet
    S->>S: Extract feature importances
    S->>P: data.apply_feature_selection()
    S-->>P: PreparedData (mutated)

    P->>LSTM: LSTMDetector.fit(data)
    LSTM->>LSTM: create_sequences()
    LSTM->>LSTM: Build BiLSTM + FocalLoss
    LSTM->>LSTM: Train with EarlyStopping
    LSTM-->>P: LSTMDetector (trained)

    P->>TN: TabNetDetector.fit(data)
    TN->>TN: Build TabNetClassifier
    TN->>TN: Train on X_balanced
    TN-->>P: TabNetDetector (trained)

    P->>E: find_best_threshold(y_val, scores)
    E-->>P: (threshold, roi)

    P->>E: evaluate(y_test, scores, name, threshold)
    E-->>P: metrics dict

    P->>P: save_artifacts()
    Note over P: Pickles results.pkl,<br/>selected_features.pkl,<br/>scalers.pkl
